Squiggle editor icons

lucide/
  Icons from Lucide, lucide-static 1.56.0 (https://lucide.dev), published 2026-10-13.
  Licence: ISC, with the Feather-derived icons under MIT. The full text is in
  lucide/LICENSE. Each file is the upstream SVG with its one-line licence
  header removed; the geometry is unchanged.

squiggle/
  Marks drawn for Squiggle by Lumina Games LLC on Lucide's grid and rules
  (24px canvas, 1px safe area, 2px round strokes, 2px corner radius).
  Same licence as the rest of this repository.

src/components/sq-icon/build-icons.mjs builds src/components/sq-icon/icons.js and the shell
asset SVGs from these sources. Edit the sources, then run:
  node src/components/sq-icon/build-icons.mjs
